# ⭐ AI Review Analyzer

An AI-powered customer review analysis automation built with **n8n and AI** that analyzes customer reviews, identifies sentiment, extracts key feedback, and helps businesses understand customer opinions more efficiently.

## 🎯 Project Overview

eCommerce businesses can receive a large number of customer reviews across their products and services.

Manually reading and analyzing every review takes time and can make it difficult to quickly identify customer concerns, recurring issues, and positive feedback.

This automation demonstrates how AI can analyze customer reviews and turn unstructured feedback into useful insights for business decision-making.

## 🚨 The Problem

Customer reviews contain valuable information, but manually analyzing large volumes of feedback can be time-consuming.

Without an automated review analysis process:

* Businesses spend time manually reading reviews
* Negative feedback may be overlooked
* Recurring customer complaints can be difficult to identify
* Valuable product feedback may not be organized
* Teams may struggle to quickly understand overall customer sentiment

## 💡 The Solution

This n8n workflow uses AI to analyze customer reviews and extract useful information from customer feedback.

The automation can:

1. Receive customer review data.
2. Send the review to an AI model for analysis.
3. Analyze the customer's sentiment.
4. Identify important topics or concerns.
5. Extract key feedback.
6. Return structured insights that can be reviewed by the business.

## 🔧 Workflow

```text
Customer Review
       ↓
n8n Workflow
       ↓
AI Analysis
       ↓
Sentiment Detection
       ↓
